  "title": "gryphon: Create pkt_info if it doesn't exist",
  "description": "Try to retrieve the per packet info data first, and create it if\nit doesn't exist, rather than assuming it is there on the second\npass. Prevents segfaults in cases with strange TCP sequence issues\n(that still show up as bugs in the TCP dissector.) Fix #17737.\n\n(cherry picked from commit ca71d1624cfb97a06e96d7c22239fdd677d666ec)",
